{% if entry.version == "v0.1.0" %}
### Release status

v0.1.0 is cut before the comparator gates (maintainer decision 2026-11-10). It has **not** cleared the three gates of org golden rule 6 (a fidelity sheet from its source, the per-PR delivery smoke, and an anchor reproducing the source's own trend). The anchor is pending, and so is the ns-3 contrib module `termite`: it is not part of this release. No result from this release counts as a benchmark number, and it does not enter the benchmarks suite until a release clears the gates; that gated release is proposed as v0.2.0 (swarm-routing/.github ROADMAP "Releases"). It ships `core/` (MIT OR GPL-2.0-only, with `core/LICENSE`) and `docs/`, as they stand on `main` at the release commit.

{% endif %}
